      ro: ["Este nodul logistic principal pentru Centrul Spațial Guyanez.", "Echipat pentru manipularea componentelor de rachete de mare tonaj.", "Funcționează sub regim de securitate ridicată.", "Leagă lanțul de aprovizionare european de baza de lansare Kourou."], 
      en: [ "Serves as an essential node for the logistics and delivery of Ariane rocket components.", "Equipped with specialized heavy-duty machinery for handling oversized aerospace cargo.", "Adheres to rigorous international security protocols for critical infrastructure.", "Handles every rocket shipment from Europe with extreme precision before onward transport." ] 
